&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:1.3pt;padding-right:1.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;美的集団の子会社と当社の合弁で中国 荊州市にJingzhou Midea-SIIX Electronics Co., Ltd.(関連会社)を設立。&lt;/p&gt;
